# Dataset Instructions

The raw PaySim dataset (`PS_20174392719_1491204439457_log.csv`, ~482 MB) and the derived sample (`sampled_transactions.csv`) are excluded from version control via `.gitignore`.

## Reproducing the Dataset

1. Download the **PaySim Synthetic Financial Dataset** from [Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ealaxi/paysim1).
2. Place the downloaded `PS_20174392719_1491204439457_log.csv` file in the root directory of this repository.
3. Run all cells in `1_data_cleaning.ipynb` to generate the stratified 5,000-row dataset (`sampled_transactions.csv`, containing 1,000 fraudulent and 4,000 normal transactions with `random_state=42`).
